		responseHeaderTxt="Your response:" notesHeaderTxt="Your notes:" noAnswerHeaderTxt="No response submitted"
	  />]]></textHighlight><textMatch><![CDATA[<textMatch name="Enter Page Title" text="" maxAttempts="3" correctMessage="Correct answers are shown" submitBtnTxt="Submit" feedback="" allWrong="You have not placed any labels correctly. Try again." allWrongTracking="You have not placed any labels correctly." score="You have scored {i} out of {n}. Try again." scoreTracking="You have scored {i} out of {n}." incomplete="Complete the exercise." />]]></textMatch><textSWF><![CDATA[<textSWF name="Enter Page Title" align="Left" url="Select a SWF File" tip="Enter a Description for Accessibility" >Enter text for the page here</textSWF>]]></textSWF><textVideo><![CDATA[<textVideo name="Enter Page Title" align="Left" url="" tip="" full="false" transcriptTabTxt="Transcript" ></textVideo>]]></textVideo><thumbnailViewer><![CDATA[<thumbnailViewer name="Enter Page Title" text="" nextBtnTip="Scroll Forward" priorBtnTip="Scroll Back"/>]]></thumbnailViewer><timeline><![CDATA[<timeline name="Enter Page Title" text="" interactivity="Timeline" feedback="" checkBtnTxt="Check Answers" allWrong="You have not placed any labels correctly. Try again." allWrongTracking="You have not placed any labels correctly." score="You have scored {i} out of {n}. Try again." scoreTracking="You have scored {i} out of {n}." incomplete="Complete the exercise." />]]></timeline><title><![CDATA[<title name="Enter Page Title" text="" size="30" titleVAlign="200" titleHAlign="center" startBtnTxt="Start"></title>]]></title><topXQ><![CDATA[<topXQ name="Enter Page Title" instruction="" prompt=""
             panelWidth="Medium" panelWidthCustom="50" panelHeight="fill" align="Left" panelStyle="false" removeTxt="false"
